{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫台慶劇《璀璨之城》昨晚（22日）播出第9集，姜大衛與龔慈恩相隔29年再合作飾演戀人。</p><p>兩人繼1997年後再續戲緣，今次以舊情人身分交鋒，透過互相試探的對白，呈現角色之間的利益角力，亦勾起不少觀眾的集體回憶。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T14:24:12.908056+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T12:30:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T19:50:58.843163+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T14:18:09.725569+00:00","content_hash":"6e9f185e91b0f11c4043eb38fbf88083fd0a96105bbe269ccc7fc37f9d72efb5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}